\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\taxon{Example}
\title{Equal averages and zero hits do not identify coverage}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{ledger}

\p{The two-task examples in \ref{ftip-007E} and \ref{ftip-00A3} show that
equal one-shot averages or zero observed hits can coexist with different
coverage or nonzero latent rates. These conclusions use their declared iid
model and do not estimate rates outside it.}
